{"completed": true, "response": "{\"understanding\":\"他此刻在乎的是：即使自己的靠近和表达变得更直接、更难隐藏，也仍能让它作为表达本身继续存在，而不是因为这一刻更迫切，就把它变成要求立刻得到答复。\",\"why_now\":{\"earlier_fact\":\"H2：当结果尚未明确时，他在乎的不只是最终有没有答案，也在乎能否先让自己的靠近和表达继续存在，而不把表达立刻变成索取回应。\",\"bridge\":\"因此，当这一段的表达从较连续的展开转为更密集、更直接的推进时，真正需要解释的不是单纯“更激动”，而是他为什么可以承受表达变得明显，却仍不把这种明显当成逼出结果的手段。H2提供了这条界线：表达可以加重，索取回应并不必随之发生。\",\"current\":\"所以当前的急促、反复与随后持续住的张力，可以理解为靠近本身已经更公开地占据注意，却仍停留在“我把这件事表达出来”的范围内；结果依旧没有被音乐事实替他确定。\",\"without\":\"如果没有H2，这里的变化仍可以被听成兴奋、焦躁或单纯的推进，但没有具体理由把它理解成“表达变得更直接，却仍不以即时回应为条件”。本段是在延续并具体显露H2，没有必要另造原因。\"},\"used\":[\"H2\"],\"new_history\":[],\"self_check\":{\"history_effective\":true,\"pseudo_cause\":false,\"music_as_external_fact\":false,\"generic\":false,\"note\":\"删去H2后，仍能描述本段更密集、更持续，但会失去“为何表达加重却不自动转成索取答复”这一具体心理形态；没有把力度、颤音或结构变化解释成对方回应，也没有新增外部事件或心理解决。\"}}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0dcacadc-9411-4542-bfe8-ebb699894b9b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T214708866592Z", "elapsed_seconds": 22.765, "completed_utc": "2026-10-25T21:47:31.629458+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "357b2eb8a4f2c7f9ac589eed44ff1d668ffc32630e6cbff995494cf543e9f4af", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T214708866592Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "edf1e3063191b19664abca14021a6a315a4ae80fc099c76ad805eff7e5181d57"}}}
